  "description": "Ride beyond expectations\nOur mid-range Kado RS is a capable and confidence-inspiring full-power, full-torque eMTB that will help you realise your riding dreams.\n\nWith an empowering ride; confidence-inspiring handling; the range to go for miles and miles; Bosch’s refined and reliable motor; an easy to remove 800Wh internal battery; our game-changing low centre of gravity design; meticulously tuned suspension for perfect control; specially curated parts, and more, Kado RS is ready to help you ride beyond your expectations – everywhere.\n\nHighlights\n– 160mm front + 150mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Carbon fibre mainframe + alloy back end is light and tough.\n– Bosch's fifth generation Performance Line CX full-torque full-power motor.\n– Ready for the latest software upgrade to unlock E-MTB+ mode + 120Nm torque + 750W peak power.\n– 800Wh removeable internal battery so you can ride further.\n– 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear.\n– Optimised low centre of gravity gives you exceptional, confidence-inspiring handling.\n\nRides like a dream\nWe’ve poured everything into Kado RS to give you the best handling and ride performance possible: an optimised low centre of gravity to give you exceptional cornering agility and balanced handling on any terrain; custom-tuned suspension for the very best grip, feedback and control; confidence-inspiring geometry, and much more. All masterfully combined to help you realise your riding dreams.\n\nCharge time: 50% in 2.3hrs from empty, and to 100% in 6.9hrs with 4A Charger.\n\nExlpore Kado's features >",
